# CR 702.16c, 702.16k, 704.5m: a player with protection from a player can't be enchanted by Auras that player controls, and
# such an Aura already attached goes to its owner's graveyard as a state-based action. Bot1 enchants itself with its own
# Curse of Opulence on turn 1; Bot2 enchants Bot1 with another on turn 2. When Absolute Virtue enters on turn 3, Bot2's Curse
# goes to Bot2's graveyard and Bot1's own stays (an Aura Bot1 controls is no opponent's). On turn 4 Bot2's second Curse can't
# be cast at Bot1 (refusal), and is cast at Bot2 instead, the positive control with the same mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Curse of Opulence
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Absolute Virtue
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Curse of Opulence
Curse of Opulence
Mox Ruby
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Curse of Opulence.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Curse of Opulence.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Curse of Opulence
? Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain; Curse of Opulence
? Bot2.Battlefield.Curse of Opulence.AttachedTo = Bot1
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Absolute Virtue.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Graveyard = Curse of Opulence
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot2.Hand.Curse of Opulence.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Hand.Curse of Opulence.Cast(Bot2)
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Curse of Opulence; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Mox Emerald; Absolute Virtue
Bot1.Battlefield.Curse of Opulence.AttachedTo = Bot1
Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain; Mox Ruby; Curse of Opulence
Bot2.Battlefield.Curse of Opulence.AttachedTo = Bot2
Bot2.Graveyard = Curse of Opulence
